    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknot the knot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Untangle the Intricate Web of Knots with Intuitive Puzzle Gameplay &amp; Realistic Knot Theory Simulation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Untangle with Simple, Intuitive Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.poster.avif?t=1755058725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.webm?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.mp4?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a puzzle experience where unraveling complex, intertwined ropes is all about insight and strategy. Enjoy a user-friendly interface that lets you focus on thoughtful problem-solving and exploration at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesmerizing, Fluid Rope Dynamics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.poster.avif?t=1755058725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.webm?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.mp4?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch as the ropes come to life with smooth, natural movements. The realistic simulation captures the fluid, almost hypnotic dance of every twist and turn, offering a visually satisfying experience that feels both organic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Simulation of Knot Theory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a90bcad53be12e061dac93c9a30c6c87.avif?t=1755058725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Built on the sophisticated principles of knot theory, every level delivers a deep and authentic mathematical challenge. Whether you're a puzzle aficionado or a math enthusiast, you'll appreciate the meticulous detail that transforms abstract concepts into tangible, interactive puzzles.<br><br>Mail:\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com\">kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com</a></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unknot the knot</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Untangle the Intricate Web of Knots with Intuitive Puzzle Gameplay &amp; Realistic Knot Theory Simulation</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Untangle with Simple, Intuitive Controls</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.poster.avif?t=1755058725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.webm?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a4865f0b5ad7a18d08ee87718acd0a69.mp4?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Dive into a puzzle experience where unraveling complex, intertwined ropes is all about insight and strategy. Enjoy a user-friendly interface that lets you focus on thoughtful problem-solving and exploration at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesmerizing, Fluid Rope Dynamics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.poster.avif?t=1755058725\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.webm?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/49ad874df80b69b2a495aa8ccdc2420e.mp4?t=1755058725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Watch as the ropes come to life with smooth, natural movements. The realistic simulation captures the fluid, almost hypnotic dance of every twist and turn, offering a visually satisfying experience that feels both organic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Simulation of Knot Theory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544020/extras/a90bcad53be12e061dac93c9a30c6c87.avif?t=1755058725\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Built on the sophisticated principles of knot theory, every level delivers a deep and authentic mathematical challenge. Whether you're a puzzle aficionado or a math enthusiast, you'll appreciate the meticulous detail that transforms abstract concepts into tangible, interactive puzzles.<br><br>Mail:\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com\">kaxon.gxxx@gmail.com</a></p>",
    "short_description": "Unknot! is a physics-simulation puzzle game where you unknot knots with simple controls, based on knot theory. Blending art, puzzles, and math, it delivers a unique experience\u2014whether you\u2019re a casual player or a hardcore puzzle enthusiast.",
